%% GTR70E WYVERN — power (2S LiPo -> onboard TPS564201 buck, no discrete UBEC; recovery is motor-driven, no recovery battery)
%% Regenerated 2026-08-12 against the fabricated custom PCB1. Pack is 450 mAh (2S) -> ~40 flights/charge per we4_deepsim.py H.
flowchart LR
    B2[2S LiPo 7.4V ~450mAh] --> SW[U13 power switch, XT30 into PCB1]
    SW --> BUCK[onboard TPS564201 buck, U15 -> ~5V rail]
    BUCK --> RAIL[5V servo/camera rail + onboard 3.3V logic LDO stage]
    RAIL --> T[RP2350B (PCB1) 3V3 -> body BNO055 + external BNO085 + BME680]
    RAIL --> SV[2 TVC servos @ 5V ~1.8 kg-cm vs ~0.56 kg-cm demand]
    BUCK --> INA[INA226 (U4) power monitor -- WIRING DEFECT: reads VBUCK output, not pack voltage; see CONFLICTS.md section 3]
    M[F15-4 motor] --> EJ[built-in ejection charge -> bulkhead joint -> chute]
